data.content:
## What Changed

Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi 10.0 upgraded to **Microsoft.OpenApi v2.x**, which targets OpenAPI v3.1. Key breaking changes:

| .NET 9 (OpenApi v1.x) | .NET 10 (OpenApi v2.x) |
|---|---|
| `OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc. | `JsonNode` (System.Text.Json) |
| `schema.Nullable = true/false` | `schema.Type = JsonSchemaType.Null \| ...` |
| `new OpenApiResponse { ... }` | Same, but `Responses` is now `IDictionary<string, OpenApiResponse>` (no change needed here) |
| `OpenApiSecurityScheme` with `Reference` | `OpenApiSchemeReference` for references |
| `new OpenApiSecurityRequirement { [scheme] = scopes }` | `new OpenApiSecurityRequirement { Scheme = ref, Scopes = list }` |

## Fixed Code

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models.References;

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        // OpenApiString is gone; use JsonNode instead
        param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
    }

    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    // Use OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference instead of manually setting Reference
    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2");

    // OpenApiSecurityRequirement is no longer a dictionary;
    // it has Scheme + Scopes properties
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new() { Scheme = oAuthScheme, Scopes = scopes }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
            {
                // Nullable property is removed in OpenAPI v3.1;
                // remove "null" from the type flags instead
                property.Value.Type = property.Value.Type & ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
            }
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

**Summary of fixes:**
1. **`OpenApiString` → `JsonValue.Create("1.0")`** — all `IOpenApiAny` primitives replaced by `JsonNode`
2. **`OpenApiSecurityScheme` with `Reference` → `new OpenApiSecuritySchemeReference("oauth2")`**
3. **`SecurityRequirement` dictionary syntax → `{ Scheme = ..., Scopes = ... }`**
4. **`schema.Nullable = false` → clear the `Null` flag from `schema.Type`** using bitwise `& ~JsonSchemaType.Null`
